  "2026-08-06T07:25:40.593Z","harness:codex","Exact-head delivery evidence: PR #916 head fea4ba930cd0d1e42766510a3c4088942c2716f3 passed every hosted runner/check, including merged exact coverage, static/docstrings, Windows, compatibility, smokes, CodeQL, Trivy, TruffleHog, Semgrep, Codecov, benchmarks, and platform runtimes. Sourcery's architecture guide and Codecov/CodSpeed reports had no actionable findings and were acknowledged with contextual replies. CodeRabbit and the formal Sourcery review were rate/quota limited; each artifact was down-voted and replied to, and is recorded as a limitation rather than approval. Greptile produced no review artifact after repeated exact-head triggers."
